{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765215,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Dead Air","festival_id":null,"organization_id":12338,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-08T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/dead-air-manipal-university-mu-jaipur-1765215","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Event Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Composition:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Team Size: 2&ndash;4 members.<\/li>\n<li>Eligibility: All currently enrolled undergraduate and postgraduate students.<\/li>\n<li>Team Formation: Inter-college and inter-specialization teams are allowed and encouraged.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Event Format &amp; Structure:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The competition is a 120-minute race divided into three phases:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Phase 1 &ndash; On-Air Challenges (45 mins): Solve 4 physical or mental puzzles to earn four 4-digit passcodes.<\/li>\n<li>Phase 2 &ndash; Decryption &amp; Hint Drop: Use the passcodes to unlock 4 encrypted files (Files 1&ndash;4). Each team receives one randomly assigned Hint File (A, B, C, or D).<\/li>\n<li>Phase 3 &ndash; AI Interrogation (60 mins): Use clues from the decrypted files and the assigned Hint File to prompt the official Gemini-powered AI, uncover the hidden storyline, recover missing broadcast scripts, and reveal the final truth.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Final Deliverables:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Teams must answer 5 final questions about the radio company's secret, the crew's fate, and the missing broadcast lines, and complete the missing broadcast.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Final Submission:<\/strong> Submit all answers and prompts through Google Forms at the designated submission desk within the allotted 15 minutes.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Restrictions:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>No AI Spamming: Use contextual clues to create precise prompts. Mindless guessing and prompt-spamming are prohibited.<\/li>\n<li>Hint File Exclusivity: Teams must not share or exchange Hint Files. Violations result in immediate disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>File Security: Main files must be unlocked using the exact passcodes earned through the challenges. Brute-forcing passwords or hacking files is strictly prohibited.<\/li>\n<li>External Assistance: Internet access is restricted to the official AI interface. Googling generic puzzle solutions is permitted, but external generative AI tools are prohibited.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Winning Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The winner is the first team to submit all 5 correct answers and successfully complete the missing broadcast. If no team achieves full accuracy, the winner will be the team with the highest accuracy in the shortest time.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Compete for a \u20b930,000 prize pool ","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":19190562,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T12:24:00+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:56:08+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"6KTHGhq","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":30,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":0,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-03 12:30:50","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxump